{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110800/extras/5cf0ee6e17893dd0009a1641b3649566.avif?t=1744105853\" width=620 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Slormancer \u2013 Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive (or dive back) into the epic and quirky universe of <i>The Slormancer</i> with its <strong>Official Original Soundtrack</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frantic battles to mysterious explorations, each track takes you right into the heart of the game. Epic melodies, fiery rhythms, and sounds that scream battle and Slorm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're farming Slorm, planning your ultimate build, or just looking for a good excuse to headbang to the beat, this soundtrack is made for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supporting the Team is Good</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong>, you're not just listening to great music\u2014you\u2019re also <strong>supporting two independent developers</strong> who put all their energy and passion into <i>The Slormancer</i>. Every purchase helps us continue enriching the game\u2019s universe and adding even more love (and Slorm).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, ready to make your ears vibrate with some Slorm in stereo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110800/extras/d894ea9a3cfe614129cc9fe9fa167bf6.avif?t=1744105853\" width=620 height=188 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1110800?t=1744105853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110800/page_bg_r